Submit a message to the Neuronet AI agent for async processing. Returns a job ID immediately without waiting for the response. After calling this, use neuronet_get_result with the returned jobId to poll for the response. Typical processing time is 30-120 seconds. Prefer this over neuronet_chat when the client has short timeouts. Each submit runs in its own fresh session: it does not see earlier submits or neuronet_chat turns, so include every piece of context the request needs in the message. Independent submits run in parallel; use neuronet_chat for a multi-turn conversation. To pick a model or thinking effort for the job, use the `model` / `thinkLevel` parameters.

